@startuml usecase-personal-rehome

title 使用案例1: 個人送養發佈流程 (BP-REHOME-002)

actor "一般會員" as User
participant "RehomeForm.vue" as Vue
participant "animals.ts" as API
participant "animals.py" as Blueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as Service
participant "Animal Model" as AnimalModel
participant "AnimalImage Model" as ImageModel
participant "Database" as DB
participant "FileUploader.vue" as Uploader
participant "uploads.py" as UploadAPI
participant "minio_helper.py" as MinIO

== 步驟1: 進入表單 ==
User -> Vue: 點選「發佈送養」
activate Vue
Vue -> User: 畫面初始化，顯示空白表單\n(步驟1:基本資訊)

== 步驟2: 填寫基本資訊 ==
User -> Vue: 填寫動物資訊
note right of User
  必填欄位：
  - 動物名稱
  - 物種 (CAT/DOG)
  - 性別 (MALE/FEMALE)
  - 年齡
  - 所在縣市
  - 描述
  選填欄位：
  - 品種
  - 顏色
  - 出生日期
  - 健康狀況
  - 行為特徵
end note

User -> Vue: 點擊「下一步」
Vue -> Vue: validateStep(0)\n驗證必填欄位

== 步驟3: 上傳照片 ==
Vue -> User: 顯示步驟2:上傳照片
User -> Vue: 選擇動物圖片\n(至少1張，JPG/PNG/GIF，單檔最大5MB)

User -> Vue: 點擊「儲存草稿」
note right: 草稿可在任何步驟儲存

Vue -> API: createAnimal(formData)
activate API
API -> Blueprint: POST /animals\n{name, species, breed, sex, dob, color, description, status: "DRAFT"}
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
Blueprint -> Service: create_animal(user, data)
activate Service

Service -> Service: 判斷動物歸屬
note right of Service
  業務邏輯：
  - 一般會員: owner_id = user_id
  - 收容所會員: shelter_id = primary_shelter_id
  - 管理員: 可指定 shelter_id
end note

Service -> AnimalModel: Animal(\n  name, species, sex, dob,\n  owner_id=user_id,\n  status=DRAFT,\n  created_by=user_id\n)
AnimalModel -> DB: INSERT INTO animals\n(...) VALUES (...)
DB --> AnimalModel: animal_id (自動生成)
AnimalModel --> Service: Animal 物件
Service --> Blueprint: Animal
Blueprint --> API: 201 Created\n{message: "動物資料建立成功", animal: {...}}
deactivate Service
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Vue: {animal: {animal_id, ...}}
deactivate API

Vue -> Vue: 儲存 animal_id\n切換至編輯模式
Vue -> User: 顯示「草稿已儲存」

== 步驟4: 上傳圖片檔案 ==
Vue -> Uploader: uploadFiles()
activate Uploader

loop 每張圖片
    Uploader -> UploadAPI: POST /uploads/presign\n{entity_type: "ANIMAL", entity_id}
    activate UploadAPI
    UploadAPI -> MinIO: generate_presigned_put_url(storage_key)
    activate MinIO
    MinIO --> UploadAPI: presigned_url (有效期15分鐘)
    deactivate MinIO
    UploadAPI --> Uploader: {url, storage_key, mime_type}
    deactivate UploadAPI
    
    Uploader -> MinIO: PUT presigned_url\n上傳檔案二進位資料
    activate MinIO
    MinIO --> Uploader: 200 OK
    deactivate MinIO
    
    Uploader -> API: addAnimalImage(animal_id,\n  {image_url, storage_key, mime_type})
    activate API
    API -> Blueprint: POST /animals/{animal_id}/images\n{storage_key, image_url, mime_type}
    activate Blueprint
    Blueprint -> Service: add_image(animal_id, user,\n  storage_key, url, mime_type)
    activate Service
    Service -> Service: 檢查權限\ncan_manage_animal(user, animal)
    Service -> ImageModel: AnimalImage(\n  animal_id, storage_key,\n  url, mime_type, order\n)
    ImageModel -> DB: INSERT INTO animal_images
    DB --> ImageModel: animal_image_id
    ImageModel --> Service: AnimalImage
    Service --> Blueprint: AnimalImage
    Blueprint --> API: 201 Created\n{message: "圖片已新增", image: {...}}
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Blueprint
    API --> Uploader: {image: {...}}
    deactivate API
end

Uploader --> Vue: onPhotosUploaded(photos)
deactivate Uploader
Vue -> User: 顯示已上傳 N 張照片

== 步驟5: 上傳醫療紀錄 (選填) ==
User -> Vue: 點擊「下一步」到步驟3
Vue -> User: 顯示醫療紀錄管理介面
opt 使用者選擇新增醫療紀錄
    User -> Vue: 點擊「新增醫療記錄」
    Vue -> User: 顯示醫療紀錄表單 Modal
    User -> Vue: 填寫醫療紀錄\n(類型、日期、提供者、詳細說明)
    User -> Vue: 上傳相關證明文件
    User -> Vue: 點擊「新增」
    note right: 醫療紀錄會在提交時\n一併儲存到資料庫
end

== 步驟6: 確認送出 ==
User -> Vue: 點擊「下一步」到步驟4
Vue -> User: 顯示資訊預覽
note right of User
  預覽內容：
  - 基本資訊摘要
  - 已上傳照片數量
  - 醫療資訊摘要
  - 提示：審核後才公開
end note

User -> Vue: 檢視資訊預覽
User -> Vue: 點擊「確認送出」

Vue -> API: submitAnimal(animal_id)
activate API
API -> Blueprint: POST /animals/{animal_id}/submit
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Service: submit_for_review(animal_id, user)
activate Service

Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL
DB --> Service: Animal 資料
Service -> Service: 檢查權限\ncan_submit_animal_for_review(user, animal)
Service -> Service: 檢查狀態 (必須是 DRAFT)
Service -> AnimalModel: animal.status = SUBMITTED\nanimal.updated_at = now()
AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status="SUBMITTED", updated_at=?\nWHERE animal_id=?
DB --> AnimalModel: 1 row affected
AnimalModel --> Service: Animal
Service --> Blueprint: Animal
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK\n{message: "送養資料已提交審核", animal: {...}}
deactivate Service
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Vue: {animal: {status: "SUBMITTED", ...}}
deactivate API

Vue -> Vue: submissionSuccess = true
Vue -> User: 顯示成功訊息
note right of User
  送出成功提示：
  「送養已提交成功！」
  「資訊將進入審核，
  審核通過後才會公開顯示」
  
  按鈕：[回首頁]
end note
deactivate Vue

== 後置條件確認 ==
note over User, DB
  ✓ 動物資料存進資料庫
  ✓ 送養狀態設為「審核中」(SUBMITTED)
  ✓ 至少一張照片已上傳
  ✓ 醫療紀錄已儲存(如有填寫)
  ✓ 等待管理員審核通過後公開顯示
  ✓ 若存檔失敗，顯示錯誤訊息
end note

@enduml
